          "slug": "returns-exchange-portal",
          "reason": "官方 /returns/ 页写明这是 'an ecommerce returns portal that decides the right outcome automatically'，可 'customize your return policy settings across different regions, warehouses, products'，并提供 exchanges、store credit、Instant Refund，以及多承运商、店内投递与 Happy Returns 无箱退货等退货方式；该页 FAQ 区块明确 'Loop Returns is a self-service returns portal that automates your entire ecommerce returns process, from policy enforcement to resolution'；/faq/ 页可核 'Our self-service portal manages returns and exchanges without support involvement' 与 'checks return eligibility'；官方文档进一步给出 'Deep Link to a Customer Order in the Return Portal'，并说明 Process Return 会触发 refunds、exchanges、store credits，Flag 则阻止自动处理并转人工复核。据此可证购物者自助发起、政策判定、解决方案选择、退货方式与请求处理状态。购物者侧生命周期展示与礼品退货流程未在正文逐项说明，属证据缺口。",
